  "details": "I converted my deformable robot avatar to VRC Constraints and was able to deform it correctly in GestureManager, but on VRChat, for some reason, the AIM Constraints and Weapon Parents on the cylinder were removed when the deformation was complete.　\n\nThere are no keys in the deformation animation to control the AIM or weapon parent.　Is this a bug?\n\nPedestal in Unity Constrait Ver.\n\navtr_3bfe2ac1-6ba5-48bb-baa0-9cee7de28ff6\n\nPedestal converted to VRC Constraints\n\navtr_dd312e3b-3974-4266-a24b-dffe1c56428c",
